      "[npc.Name] [npc.verb(shoot)] [npc2.name] with [npc.her] #IF game.isSillyModeEnabled() #THEN taser with a shout of [npc.speech(I am the law!)] #ELSE taser. #ENDIF There is a loud bang and then a brilliant pink and purple flash as [npc2.namePos] energy is drained! The spent cartridge pops out and [npc.name] [npc.verb(insert)] another one into the taser.",
      "[npc.Name] [npc.verb(fire)] [npc.her] taser. [npc2.Name] suddenly [npc2.verb(find)] metal darts embedded in [npc2.her] aura before being surrounded by pulsating streams of arcane lightning! [npc2.sheHasFull] lost some energy! The spent cartridge clatters on the ground and [npc.name] [npc.verb(insert)] another one into the taser."
